`AndroidManifest.xml` ek alag file hai `build.gradle` se — dono cheezein Android project mein alag kaam karti hain:

- **`AndroidManifest.xml`** — permissions, activities register karta hai (ye humne abhi fix ki thi)
- **`build.gradle` (app level)** — libraries/dependencies add karne ke liye (jaise ab fingerprint wali library)

Agar aap manifest file dobara dekhna chahte hain, wo maine pehle hi upar bana kar di thi — [yahan se dekh sakte hain](#) ya main dobara bhej deta hoon:

**`build.gradle` GitHub par kaise dhoondein:**

1. Repo kholein `IBTISAAM-Kiryana-Store`
2. `app` folder par tap karein
3. Us mein `build.gradle` (ya `build.gradle.kts`) file dikhegi — usko open karein
4. `dependencies { ... }` block ke andar ye line paste karein:
```
implementation "androidx.biometric:biometric:1.1.0"
```
5. Commit karein

Agar `app` folder mein ye file nahi mil rahi, screenshot bhej dein — main dikha doonga kahan hai.
